OL,3,GNEWSAGrindr used to target victims,
OL,4,Apolice believe
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice believe dating app Grindr has
OL,7,Fbeen used to target possible robbery
OL,8,Fvictims.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police said two incidents took
OL,11,Fplace in Gildencroft Quaker Cemetery in
OL,12,FChatham Street in Norwich and a third
OL,13,Fincident at Gunton skatepark in the
OL,14,Fcity between 21 August and 29 August.
OL,16,FThe force said in two of these
OL,17,Fincidents, the dating app was used by
OL,18,Fthe suspects to organise a meeting.
